<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28577" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠναστ-εία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>power, lordship, domination</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				593
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὀλίγων ἀνδρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.62
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτικαὶ δ.</span>
			<i>the exercise of</i> political <i>power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				176c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τὰς δ. ἔχοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.18.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>close oligarchy</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσονομία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.78
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				2.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.4.46
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῶν ὀλίγων δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					291d
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολιτεία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1272b10
			</span></i>; distd.fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλιγαρχία</span>,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1292b10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1293a31
			</span></i>: in pl., of the Roman Senate, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				52.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl.,
				<i>mighty deeds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				13.12
			</span></i>, al.</div>
